# This directory contains ONNX model files.
# Run 'make model' to download and export the QRdet model.
#
# Files:
#   - qrdet-s.pt   : PyTorch model (downloaded from GitHub releases)
#   - qrdet-s.onnx : ONNX model (exported from PyTorch)
#
# These files are not committed to git due to their size (~20-50MB).
